3eeeded3f3b03038249517, https://si.imgix.net/1722b227/uploads/origins/5df0dd4c-042a-42bd-b2d7-248f9dd24dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0f1869baf0c9f69a9a933e688fd8f54 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1722b227/uploads/origins/5df0dd4c-042a-42bd-b2d7-248f9dd24dd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8e880b5a8a385406596495bfb42fb2d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I was hoping to get a drawing of my character. I would like the background to be transparent. The file should be a PSD or PNG. You can draw the character in whichever pose you would like. My character has a sword but including that is optional! I would like to use this art potentially for YouTube. Https://twitter.com/shyAkamori/status/1341253271688765441/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kirikawa_juu/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d09da937/uploads/origins/6261bd91-1b89-4b9d-b68c-59301fe40086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7065b02ec146cf9b86cb684ab8385da0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d09da937/uploads/origins/6261bd91-1b89-4b9d-b68c-59301fe40086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7065b02ec146cf9b86cb684ab8385da0, https://si.imgix.net/d09da937/uploads/origins/6261bd91-1b89-4b9d-b68c-59301fe40086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49dca1de4b98fbebe6e5917e5830a181 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d09da937/uploads/origins/6261bd91-1b89-4b9d-b68c-59301fe40086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05432d90757f5546029d7c71b64bb0b9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。オリジナルのキャラクターを描いていただきたいのですが、名前はゼノですジャケットかベストのバージョンでお願いします(https://imgur.com/a/Ckm6eZy)\n\n拳銃を撃った後に画面を見ているポーズを希望します。\n(https://imgur.com/a/lBndObp)\n\n冷たくて暗い表情をしている\n\n背景は何でも構いません。\n\nこの作品は私のtwitchやyoutubeで使用したいので、問題がある場合はご遠慮ください。背景